# UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer suppressions for `make test-python-asan`. One entry
# per report, each with a reason. Keep entries narrow: one check, one function.
#
# Not a false positive: a zero codelength makes the recursive partition divide by
# zero when it prints the compression ("Recursive nan%"). Only the printed
# percentage is wrong (#1234). Suppressed so it does not stop the run before the rest of
# the suite. Remove with the fix for #1234.
float-divide-by-zero:infomap::InfomapBase::recursivePartition
